(text "U3 = direct paths (L->L on its left channel, R->R on its right).  U4 = cross paths (L->R on its left channel, R->L on its right).\nSPI chain: XIAO MOSI (D10) -> U8 isolator -> U3 SDI, U3 SDO -> U4 SDI. 32 clocks per update: U4 word first, then U3; each word is right byte then left byte, MSB first.\nZCEN high: gain changes wait for a zero crossing. Code 192 = 0 dB, 0 = mute. Logic supply is +5VA from U10 (sheet 5), on the audio ground; SDO stays on this side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1e447711-9935-42d9-83b9-bbfd5df1452a"))
(label "L_SUM" (at 162.56 66.04 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "d9ba14b6-78fc-40d7-89dc-09b46b8a4140"))
